  ],
  "solution_ref": "$a_1=\\frac13$, $n\\ge2$: $\\frac1{(2n-1)a_n}=2n+1$ → $a_n=\\frac1{(2n-1)(2n+1)}$ ($n=1$도 성립). $\\sum_{n=1}^{10}=\\frac12\\left(1-\\frac1{21}\\right)=\\frac{10}{21}$",
